+++ b/README.reia-shell.md
@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+# Reia Shell Minimal Scaffold (Web/PWA first)
+
+## What is included
+
+- `apps/reia-shell`: Vite + React + TypeScript frontend
+  - Mobile-friendly UI
+  - Chat input/output
+  - Avatar state panel
+  - PWA-ready manifest via `vite-plugin-pwa`
+- `services/reia-gateway`: Node + Express mock gateway
+  - `GET /health`
+  - `POST /api/chat` mock (echo reply + avatar event)
+- `packages/reia-events`: shared avatar event schema (Zod)
+
+## Local run (recommended)
+
+```bash
+pnpm install
+pnpm dev:reia
+```
+
+This starts both frontend and gateway.
+
+- Frontend: `http://localhost:5177`
+- Gateway: `http://localhost:8787`
+
+## Manual run
+
+Terminal A:
+
+```bash
+pnpm -F @proj-airi/reia-gateway dev
+```
+
+Terminal B:
+
+```bash
+pnpm -F @proj-airi/reia-shell dev
+```
+
+## Mobile browser test (same LAN)
+
+1. Start with `pnpm dev:reia`
+2. Find dev machine IP (example `192.168.1.20`)
+3. Open on phone:
+   - `http://192.168.1.20:5177`
+4. If gateway URL differs, set env:
+
+```bash
+VITE_REIA_GATEWAY_URL=http://192.168.1.20:8787 pnpm -F @proj-airi/reia-shell dev
+```
+
+## API quick check
+
+```bash
+curl http://localhost:8787/health
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8787/api/chat \
+  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
+  -d '{"message":"hello"}'
+```
